{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/785662-what-family-dinner-looks-like","id":785662,"title":"What Family Dinner looks like","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-13T18:17:21-08:00","id":785662,"title":"What Family Dinner looks like","content":"So a recent discussion reminded me that I didn't have a clear sense of what Family Dinner actually looks like. The way it's described, all that's required is that the Beast view the hunting and feeding in person in order to satisfy the need, right?<br /> <br /> So on the one hand that's cool. On the other hand, it does conjure up a slightly comical &quot;peeping tom&quot; image of the Beast, all wide-eyed between the floorboards as the Vampire gets to eatin' above.<br /> <br /> Maybe it's just that I haven't re-read the fiction in awhile, but is there anything more to what Family Dinner looks like? Is it described in the fiction of the book anywhere? Do you guys have any ideas on how to supe it up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T18:20:18-08:00","id":785665,"title":"","content":"Something like this, I'd imagine:<br /> <img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tLPZmPaHme0/maxresdefault.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"