mber","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T19:06:56-08:00","id":785691,"title":"","content":"There's a 'View from Without' on page 62 describes a lurking Beast from a Werewolf's perspective. The peeping tom approach is definitely viable, but the Beast can also participate more actively, if so inclined.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T19:47:09-08:00","id":785710,"title":"","content":"Varies depending on the nature. I mean there's a difference between stalking a vampire and just feeding by proxy when they ambush someone in an ally and tear into someone's throat vs helping out a friend in which case it might be a case of taking what you want from the catch when they get what they want. Though to anyone just observing on the superficial level the Beast is just someone hanging around doing whatever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T04:22:10-08:00","id":785887,"title":"","content":"I treat it as a voyeuristic rush. Everyone does that differently. Peeping, yes. Standing over someone else's shoulder and giving suggestions is another way. I'm sure there's others. They're not the main participants, but they get a thrill as if they were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}